{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "the-old-capital",
  "chunk_id": "the-old-capital-chunk-0445",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“赏夜樱的祇园呗。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "“The Gion song for viewing the night cherry blossoms.”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "母亲口若悬河地说了起来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Mother began speaking in a lively, unbroken stream,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "“我以前好像也说过，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "“I think I may have told you this before,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "在樱花树下的椅子上，躺着一个非常可爱的婴儿，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but on a bench beneath the cherry tree, there was an incredibly lovely baby lying there,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "她看到我们，就绽开花一般的笑脸，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and when she saw us, her face opened into a smile like a flower,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "让人不得不把她抱起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so that one could not help picking her up.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "一旦抱起来，就放不下手，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Once I had picked her up, I could not put her down,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "真叫人喜欢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she was that lovable.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "我贴着她的脸，望着你爹。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I pressed my cheek against hers and looked at your father.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "他说：阿繁，把这个孩儿偷走吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He said, ‘Oshige, let us steal this child away.’",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "我问：什么？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I asked, ‘What?’",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "他又说：阿繁，快跑，快逃跑呀！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He said again, ‘Oshige, run, hurry and run away!’",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "后来我们就拼命地跑。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After that, we ran for all we were worth.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00445",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "记得好像是在专卖芋棒 [6] 的平野屋附近仓忙跳上车的……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I seem to remember that near Hirano-ya, the shop specializing in imobo [6], we hastily jumped into a car...”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
